posts.body:
I agree with
@Aerosys
RPG Maker should have an in-engine method (without the use of plugins) to customize your menus and UI elements in a future installment. Maybe allow us to move the different windows around in however we see fit. Being artistic, I want to find every excuse to customize the look of my game's UI so SRD HUD Maker has been a godsend.

@Soul_Narrative_Games
yeah I was thinking like Effekseer.
@Tai_MT
yeah the "optimize" feature currently sucks.
